
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

read_data       relaxed.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0.052712539 -0.014602681 -0.03128485) to (40.995287 40.641587 42.187285)
  3 by 2 by 5 MPI processor grid
